{
  "finding": "F051",
  "rule": "REME-0101800003",
  "service": "autoscaling",
  "status": "reproducible",
  "note": "Raw/Service/autoscaling.py:72-91 — ASG 최상위 LaunchTemplate 이 있을 때만 시작 템플릿 버전을 붙이고, MixedInstancesPolicy·LaunchConfiguration ASG 는 LaunchTemplate={LaunchTemplateVersions:{}}. Analyze autoscaling.py:153-155 는 NetworkInterfaces 가 없으면 취약. 템플릿 데이터는 ec2.describe_launch_templates[].LaunchTemplateVersions, 시작 구성은 autoscaling.describe_launch_configurations 에 수집돼 있어 룰에서 대조할 수 있다(bug).",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "mixed-instances-policy",
      "role": "bug",
      "condition": "MixedInstancesPolicy ASG(EKS 관리형 노드그룹 형태) — 참조하는 시작 템플릿 lt-0b2 v1 은 AssociatePublicIpAddress=false",
      "args": [],
      "raw": {
        "ap-northeast-2": {
          "autoscaling": {
            "describe_auto_scaling_groups": [
              {
                "AutoScalingGroupName": "asg-mip",
                "AutoScalingGroupARN": "arn:aws:autoscaling:ap-northeast-2:111122223333:autoScalingGroup:x:autoScalingGroupName/asg-mip",
                "MinSize": 1,
                "MaxSize": 2,
                "DesiredCapacity": 1,
                "AvailabilityZones": [
                  "ap-northeast-2a",
                  "ap-northeast-2c"
                ],
                "Instances": [],
                "Tags": {},
                "MixedInstancesPolicy": {
                  "LaunchTemplate": {
                    "LaunchTemplateSpecification": {
                      "LaunchTemplateId": "lt-0b2",
                      "LaunchTemplateName": "lt-0b2-name",
                      "Version": "1"
                    },
                    "Overrides": [
                      {
                        "InstanceType": "m5.large"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "InstancesDistribution": {
                    "OnDemandBaseCapacity": 0,
                    "OnDemandPercentageAboveBaseCapacity": 100
                  }
                },
                "LaunchTemplate": {
                  "LaunchTemplateVersions": {}
                }
              }
            ],
            "describe_launch_configurations": []
          },
          "ec2": {
            "describe_launch_templates": [
              {
                "LaunchTemplateId": "lt-0b2",
                "LaunchTemplateName": "lt-0b2-name",
                "DefaultVersionNumber": 1,
                "LatestVersionNumber": 1,
                "Tags": {},
                "LaunchTemplateVersions": [
                  {
                    "LaunchTemplateId": "lt-0b2",
                    "LaunchTemplateName": "lt-0b2-name",
                    "VersionNumber": 1,
                    "DefaultVersion": true,
                    "LaunchTemplateData": {
                      "ImageId": "ami-0abc",
                      "NetworkInterfaces": [
                        {
                          "DeviceIndex": 0,
                          "AssociatePublicIpAddress": false,
                          "Groups": [
                            "sg-1"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "describe_instances": [],
            "describe_addresses": []
          }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "verdict": "Secure",
        "good": 1
      },
      "why": "실제 시작 템플릿이 공용 IP 연결을 끄고 있으므로 양호 — 템플릿을 조회하지 않았다는 이유로 취약이면 안 된다"
    },
